Z||000016||Screwie||12-03-2001||09:21 AM||||I don't think it's the bike itself that is revolutionary. I mean, I can ride a bike and stop and go when I want without all that technology. I don't think that's the biggest plus of this invention. And well, a little electric device and a third wheel will indeed do the same thing. The technology behind it though, the fact that it is able to balance itself is very interesting though.<P>But c'mon, "it's going to change the world" that's what these people that want to sell the magazine, made up. That's also why they were so "mysterious" about the whole product. And they themselves now use it to sell their product. The oldest trick in the marketing book.||||reg||1
