Z||000027||falconhulk||12-03-2001||03:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 84fierotrevor:<BR><B>a pogo stick that won't tip over ? then what's the point of it ?<BR>also that wouldn't be possible because all that keep's it from tiping over are the wheel's basicly it senses u going one way and it goes that way to keep you balenced<BR>nothing big so it wouldn't really work in airplanes or suv's or pogostick's, motorcycle's or anything.<BR>but ur right, With all the tech they have in that they could use it for some pretty cool thing's !</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Wrong!  It uses gyroscopes to keep balance.  If it went the other way from you while you were tiping another the whole thing would fall over.  Thats not balance.||||reg||1
